    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Kavanagh et al. (2013) phalangeal Inhibitory Cascade & Hiscock et al. (2017) BMP-GDF5-Noggin synovial joint interzone segmentation, with Pass 3 reduced Biot poroelastic synovial cavitation — Morphometric validation: 90/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Credited: `measure_morphoeval()` (L1561-1742) returns 16 metrics, all with `reference_value`, `reference_source` and `unit` keys (asserted in self-test check 7); the seven Pass 3 metrics anchor cavity counts to Edwards 1994 / Drachman 1966 / Kahn 2009, and introduce an output-derived specimen statistic (joint-line s/c) that the model statistic is compared with. Deductions: two of the new metrics (Sox9 reversion ratio, loading threshold m*) carry `reference_value: null` because no published magnitude exists — they are model predictions, not validations (-4); the model s/c reference is the specimen mean whose sd exceeds it, so the agreement (|diff| < 0.05 in check 12) is weak (-3); the permeability metric is a boolean monotonicity flag rather than a measured quantity (-2); the Pass 2 lambda_c \"reference\" 3.5904 is still the model's own value (-1)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py L1598–L1619: Sox9 reversion ratio and loading threshold have reference_value null (no literature magnitude) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py#L1598-L1619>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-measurement-biological-specimen-segmented-middle-phalanx-proportion-p2-p1-p2-p3>,
